{"parse": {"title": "笑点胡椒", "pageid": 118669, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"item-infobox\"><div style=\"position:absolute; width:100%; height:100%; overflow:hidden;\"><div class=\"glow-top\"><div></div></div><div class=\"glow-bottom\"><div></div></div></div><div class=\"item-infobox-box\"><div class=\"item-infobox-image\"><img alt=\"笑点胡椒\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/1/14/CurrencyItem-310103.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"笑点胡椒\" width=\"256\" height=\"256\" class=\"img-fit mid-position\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></div><div class=\"item-infobox-content\"><div class=\"serif\" style=\"font-size:22px\"><b>笑点胡椒</b><img alt=\"CurrencyIcon-310103 1.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5c/CurrencyIcon-310103_1.png/24px-CurrencyIcon-310103_1.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5c/CurrencyIcon-310103_1.png/36px-CurrencyIcon-310103_1.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5c/CurrencyIcon-310103_1.png/48px-CurrencyIcon-310103_1.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"54\" data-file-height=\"54\" /><div class=\"hide-m test-hide grey-small\" style=\"float:right; font-family:sans-serif; font-size:16px\"><span class=\"no-select\">编号ID：</span>2#310103</div></div><hr /><div>好梦井中打捞上来的奇异造物，可以在“茸毛集换所”中兑换奖励。</div><div style=\"color:#696969\">精灵的泉水混合“仙境”的糖浆，荒原的大地裂隙由此开始吐出馈赠。据婴儿蓝所说，这种胡椒是“仙境”茶歇时间中的珍品，至少她那位咧着嘴的朋友对此十分喜爱。</div><span class=\"item-infobox-subtitle\"><small class=\"serif\" style=\"white-space:nowrap; font-weight:bold; color:#555\">来源</small><hr class=\"inline\" /></span><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"source-stage\"></td><td class=\"source-text\">好梦井</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "物品"}], "displaytitle": "笑点胡椒"}}